              "type": "method",
              "name": "zipDir",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>filePath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 目录路径</li>\n<li><strong>destZipPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 目标 ZIP 路径</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"zipOptionsType\">ZipOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"zipNativeObjectType\">ZipNativeObject</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将目录创建为 ZIP. 内部调用 <code>ZipFile.createSplitZipFileFromFolder(file, zipParameters, false, -1)</code>.</p>\n",
