        {
          "textRaw": "[m] unzip",
          "name": "[m]_unzip",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "unzip(zipPath, destPath, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "unzip",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>zipPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>destPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 解压目标目录</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"zipOptionsType\">ZipOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"zipNativeObjectType\">ZipNativeObject</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>解压 ZIP 到目标目录. 第二个参数为对象时会被识别为 <code>options</code>, <code>destPath</code> 按空字符串解析.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">zip.unzip(&#39;./logs.zip&#39;, &#39;./logs&#39;);\nzip.unzip(&#39;./secret.zip&#39;, &#39;./out&#39;, { password: &#39;secret&#39; });\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">ZipNativeObject</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p><code>ZipNativeObject</code> 是每次 <code>zip.open</code> / <code>zipFile</code> / <code>zipDir</code> / <code>zipFiles</code> / <code>unzip</code> 返回的操作对象. 构造失败或操作失败时, 内部会尝试关闭底层 <code>ZipFile</code> 后再抛出异常.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "zipPath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "zipPath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "destPath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "unzip(zipPath, options)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "unzip",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>zipPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>destPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 解压目标目录</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"zipOptionsType\">ZipOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"zipNativeObjectType\">ZipNativeObject</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>解压 ZIP 到目标目录. 第二个参数为对象时会被识别为 <code>options</code>, <code>destPath</code> 按空字符串解析.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">zip.unzip(&#39;./logs.zip&#39;, &#39;./logs&#39;);\nzip.unzip(&#39;./secret.zip&#39;, &#39;./out&#39;, { password: &#39;secret&#39; });\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">ZipNativeObject</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p><code>ZipNativeObject</code> 是每次 <code>zip.open</code> / <code>zipFile</code> / <code>zipDir</code> / <code>zipFiles</code> / <code>unzip</code> 返回的操作对象. 构造失败或操作失败时, 内部会尝试关闭底层 <code>ZipFile</code> 后再抛出异常.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "zipPath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
